  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water and add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Cook penne over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 12 mins.\n• Reserve pasta water (2 tbs per person). Drain penne, then return to saucepan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2043591ea8bdcc9dd187/step-fc6d3900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a good drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook snacking tomatoes, stirring occasionally, until blistered, 4-5 mins.\n• Add garlic and tomato & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2043591ea8bdcc9dd187/step-22a45a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to low, then add light cooking cream, cannellini beans, reserved pasta water and the stock powder. Simmer until slightly reduced, 2-3 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat, stir through cooked penne and baby spinach leaves until wilted and combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2043591ea8bdcc9dd187/step-dffaf420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Tuscan white bean and cherry tomato penne between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over Parmesan cheese and garnish with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2043591ea8bdcc9dd187/step-1fdfd230.jpg"
    }
  ]
